Package: nekohub-agent
Version: 0.4.1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: nekoHub contributors
Depends: adduser, systemd
Homepage: https://github.com/awakyy1/nekohub
Description: Native Linux metrics agent for nekoHub
 A small read-only daemon that collects host metrics from procfs and sysfs,
 serves the local nekoHub TUI, and exposes Prometheus-compatible metrics.
